,{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m025-0218","start":218,"end":220,"surface":"丕豹","kind":"person","person_id":"rlv_clg_euu_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m025-0224","start":224,"end":226,"surface":"繆公","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m025-0229","start":229,"end":231,"surface":"晉君","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、短稱或官稱指代待核；不補造姓名或自動合併。"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m025-0244","start":244,"end":246,"surface":"繆公","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m025-0281","start":281,"end":282,"surface":"豹","kind":"person","person_id":"rlv_clg_euu_A","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-005-qin","book_id":"b-shiji-005","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-005-qin"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p029","text":"十九年，獻公曰：「始吾先君莊伯、武公之誅晉亂，而虢常助晉伐我，又匿晉亡公子，果爲亂。弗誅，後遺子孫憂。」乃使荀息以屈産之乘假道於虞。虞假道，遂伐虢，取其下陽以歸。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m029-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"獻公","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m029-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"莊伯","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m029-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"武公","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m029-0054","start":54,"end":56,"surface":"荀息","kind":"person","person_id":"g14_wpb_odv","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","book_id":"b-shiji-039","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-039-jin"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p034","text":"是歳也，晉復假道於虞以伐虢。虞之大夫宮之奇諫虞君曰：「晉不可假道也，是且滅虞。」虞君曰：「晉我同姓，不宜伐我。」宮之奇曰：「太伯、虞仲，太王之子也，太伯亡去，是以不嗣。虢仲、虢叔，王季之子也，爲文王卿士，其記勳在王室，藏於盟府。將虢是滅，何愛于虞？且虞之親能親於桓、莊之族乎？桓、莊之族何罪，盡滅之。虞之與虢，脣之與齒，脣亡則齒寒。」虞公不聽，遂許晉。宮之奇以其族去虞。其冬，晉滅虢，虢公丑奔周。還，襲滅虞，虜虞公及其大夫井伯百里奚以媵秦穆姬，而修虞祀。荀息牽曩所遺虞屈産之乘馬奉之獻公，獻公笑曰：「馬則吾馬，齒亦老矣！」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m034-0018","start":18,"end":21,"surface":"宮之奇","kind":"person","person_id":"nu4_0wz_9o2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m034-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"虞君","kind":"person","person_id":"2en_16a_r4i","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m034-0040","start":40,"end":42,"surface":"虞君","kind":"person","person_id":"2en_16a_r4i","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m034-0056","start":56,"end":59,"surface":"宮之奇","kind":"person","person_id":"nu4_0wz_9o2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m034-0062","start":62,"end":64,"surface":"太伯","kind":"person","person_id":"5dm_e40_rqh_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m034-0065","start":65,"end":67,"surface":"虞仲","kind":"person","person_id":"u3q_fto_w1f_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m034-0068","start":68,"end":70,"surface":"太王","kind":"person","person_id":"u3q_fto_w1f","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m034-0074","start":74,"end":76,"surface":"太伯","kind":"person","person_id":"5dm_e40_rqh_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m034-0084","start":84,"end":86,"surface":"虢仲","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_C","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m034-0087","start":87,"end":89,"surface":"虢叔","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m034-0090","start":90,"end":92,"surface":"王季","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m034-0097","start":97,"end":99,"surface":"文王","kind":"person","person_id":"j3c_ajp_44x","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m034-0131","start":131,"end":13