以三公子之徒作亂，謂荀息曰：「三怨將起，秦、晉輔之，子將何如？」荀息曰：「吾不可負先君言。」十月，裏克殺奚齊于喪次，獻公未葬也。荀息將死之，或曰不如立奚齊弟悼子而傅之，荀息立悼子而葬獻公。十一月，裏克弒悼子于朝，荀息死之。君子曰：「詩所謂『白珪之玷，猶可磨也，斯言之玷，不可爲也』，其荀息之謂乎！不負其言。」初，獻公將伐驪戎，卜曰「齒牙爲禍」。及破驪戎，獲驪姬，愛之，竟以亂晉。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m038-0006","start":6,"end":9,"surface":"齊桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"9w2_c77_53m","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m038-0017","start":17,"end":20,"surface":"晉獻公","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m038-0029","start":29,"end":33,"surface":"周之宰孔","kind":"person","person_id":"svx_710_4bw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m038-0034","start":34,"end":36,"surface":"宰孔","kind":"person","person_id":"svx_710_4bw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m038-0039","start":39,"end":42,"surface":"齊桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"9w2_c77_53m","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m038-0069","start":69,"end":71,"surface":"獻公","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m038-0083","start":83,"end":85,"surface":"荀息","kind":"person","person_id":"g14_wpb_odv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m038-0090","start":90,"end":92,"surface":"奚齊","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4_AAC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m038-0115","start":115,"end":117,"surface":"荀息","kind":"person","person_id":"g14_wpb_odv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m038-0123","start":123,"end":125,"surface":"獻公","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m038-0158","start":158,"end":160,"surface":"奚齊","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4_AAC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m038-0161","start":161,"end":163,"surface":"荀息","kind":"person